7-the-blanket-drive-p5-s2","ord":1,"text":"Mina had already put three blankets into the box on Ms. Park's desk.","translation_ko":"Mina는 이미 Park 선생님 책상의 상자에 담요 세 장을 넣어 두었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-197-the-blanket-drive/audio/p5-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Mina","charStart":0,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":440},{"word":"had","charStart":5,"charEnd":8,"startMs":440,"endMs":800},{"word":"already","charStart":9,"charEnd":16,"startMs":800,"endMs":1380},{"word":"put","charStart":17,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1380,"endMs":1620},{"word":"three","charStart":21,"charEnd":26,"startMs":1620,"endMs":2100},{"word":"blankets","charStart":27,"charEnd":35,"startMs":2100,"endMs":2480},{"word":"into","charStart":36,"charEnd":40,"startMs":2480,"endMs":2820},{"word":"the","charStart":41,"charEnd":44,"startMs":2820,"endMs":3000},{"word":"box","charStart":45,"charEnd":48,"startMs":3000,"endMs":3260},{"word":"on","charStart":49,"charEnd":51,"startMs":3260,"endMs":3480},{"word":"Ms","charStart":52,"charEnd":54,"startMs":3480,"endMs":3720},{"word":"Park's","charStart":56,"charEnd":62,"startMs":3860,"endMs":4060},{"word":"desk","charStart":63,"charEnd":67,"startMs":4060,"endMs":4360}]},{"id":"daily-197-the-blanket-drive-p5-s3","ord":2,"text":"\"Wow, you were fast!\" Jun said, surprised.","translation_ko":"\"와, 정말 빠르다!\" Jun이 놀라며 말했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-197-the-blanket-drive/audio/p5-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Wow","charStart":1,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":440},{"word":"you","charStart":6,"charEnd":9,"startMs":640,"endMs":880},{"word":"were","charStart":10,"charEnd":14,"startMs":880,"endMs":1100},{"word":"fast","charStart":15,"charEnd":19,"startMs":1100,"endMs":2260},{"word":"Jun","charStart":22,"charEnd":25,"startMs":2260,"endMs":2260},{"word":"said","charStart":26,"charEnd":30,"startMs":2260,"endMs":2520},{"word":"surprised","charStart":32,"charEnd":41,"startMs":2900,"endMs":3300}]}]},{"id":"daily-197-the-blanket-drive-p6","pageNo":6,"spread":"p6","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-1