-p8-s3","ord":2,"text":"She had kind eyes and a warm smile.","translation_ko":"할머니는 다정한 눈빛과 따뜻한 미소를 가지고 계셨어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-197-the-blanket-drive/audio/p8-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"She","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":260},{"word":"had","charStart":4,"charEnd":7,"startMs":260,"endMs":540},{"word":"kind","charStart":8,"charEnd":12,"startMs":540,"endMs":940},{"word":"eyes","charStart":13,"charEnd":17,"startMs":940,"endMs":1400},{"word":"and","charStart":18,"charEnd":21,"startMs":1400,"endMs":1740},{"word":"a","charStart":22,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1740,"endMs":2060},{"word":"warm","charStart":24,"charEnd":28,"startMs":2060,"endMs":2220},{"word":"smile","charStart":29,"charEnd":34,"startMs":2220,"endMs":2620}]}]},{"id":"daily-197-the-blanket-drive-p9","pageNo":9,"spread":"p9","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-197-the-blanket-drive/p9.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-197-the-blanket-drive-p9-s1","ord":0,"text":"\"Oh my, so many blankets! Thank you so much,\" Mrs. Choi said softly.","translation_ko":"\"어머, 담요가 이렇게 많네요! 정말 고마워요,\" 최 할머니가 부드럽게 말씀하셨어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-197-the-blanket-drive/audio/p9-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Oh","charStart":1,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":400},{"word":"my","charStart":4,"charEnd":6,"startMs":400,"endMs":760},{"word":"so","charStart":8,"charEnd":10,"startMs":1360,"endMs":1560},{"word":"many","charStart":11,"charEnd":15,"startMs":1560,"endMs":1900},{"word":"blankets","charStart":16,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1900,"endMs":2340},{"word":"Thank","charStart":26,"charEnd":31,"startMs":3100,"endMs":3240},{"word":"you","charStart":32,"charEnd":35,"startMs":3240,"endMs":3520},{"word":"so","charStart":36,"charEnd":38,"startMs":3520,"endMs":3780},{"word":"much","charStart":39,"charEnd":43,"startMs":3780,"endMs":4100},{"word":"Mrs","charStart":46,"charEnd":49,"startMs":4540,"endMs":4740},{"word":"Choi","charStart":51,"charEnd":55,"startMs":5000,"endMs":5040},{"word":"said","charStart":56,"charEnd":60,"startMs":5040,"endMs"